<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:36,450
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Incomprehensible</font>

32
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:36,450
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Targeted Merchants</font>

33
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did they really come this way?</font>

34
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why come this way?</font>

35
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:50,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They shouldn't come this way
if it's as you say, Choji.</font>

36
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said that because I didn't think
we were being targeted.</font>

37
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think this is
the time to argue...</font>

38
00:01:58,220 --> 00:02:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to formulate
some sort of strategy.</font>

39
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say that, but...</font>

40
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

41
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have the guys
you spoke of caught up?</font>

42
00:02:08,350 --> 00:02:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we should divide up
this group in two.</font>

43
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it's hard enough
to protect one.</font>

44
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the point of dividing
the group in two?</font>

45
00:02:16,650 --> 00:02:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

46
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, tell us what your idea is.</font>

47
00:02:23,950 --> 00:02:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what I mean.</font>

48
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example...</font>

49
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's say there are
ten persimmons here.</font>

50
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is anything okay if it's a food?</font>

51
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

52
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:41,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I want it to be ramen!</font>

53
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, it's an example, so...</font>

54
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll make it ramen.</font>

55
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone is after
these ten bowls of ramen.</font>

56
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there are three people
to protect the ramen.</font>

57
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so one person has
to protect roughly three bowls.</font>

58
00:02:56,980 --> 00:02:58,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no. If it's ramen,</font>

59
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we should just eat it all
before they come.</font>

60
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would settle things.</font>

61
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto. This ramen is
for delivery to someone,</font>

62
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we can't eat it.</font>

63
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? But the ramen
won't be tasty if it gets soggy.</font>

64
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm moving on.</font>

65
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If three people protect
ten bowls of ramen,</font>

66
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one person protects
about three bowls.</font>

67
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this ramen has
legs for escaping.</font>

68
00:03:25,010 --> 00:03:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen with legs for escaping?!</font>

69
00:03:27,850 --> 00:03:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five bowls of ramen
quick to escape...</font>

70
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and five bowls of ramen
slow to escape.</font>

71
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right..
Things are kind of getting crazy.</font>

72
00:03:39,650 --> 00:03:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. If we divide them
into two groups...</font>

73
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, the pursuers would target
the group that is slow to escape first.</font>

74
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we have one person
defend the preceding group</font>

75
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and two people
for the group that is slow to escape.</font>

76
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, right.</font>

77
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By doing this, as for protecting
the slow group,</font>

78
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">now one person can just protect
two and a half bowls.</font>

79
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

80
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, the ramen that are
quick to escape are the young people</font>

81
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the ramen that are slow to escape are
the elderly people and children, right?</font>

82
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly.
Not only will the possibility of</font>

83
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the former to completely
get away increase,</font>

84
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the burden on the latter
to protect will decrease.</font>

85
00:04:19,650 --> 00:04:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a strategy that kills two birds
with one stone.</font>

86
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're smart.</font>

87
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...
the elderly people and children will...</font>

88
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just stated a rational idea.</font>

89
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's the possibility</font>

90
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of complete annihilation
if we stay in a group.</font>

91
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:35,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I wrong, Yurinoshin?</font>

92
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

93
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it's settled.
Let's divide everyone up in two.</font>

94
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, gramps.</font>

95
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about it.</font>

96
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:51,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be trouble if something bad
were to happen to the men in their prime.</font>

97
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a wife and kid
at home, right?</font>

98
00:04:56,520 --> 00:05:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll be going on
ahead first, Naruto, Choji.</font>

99
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.
We're counting on you, Hinata.</font>

100
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and I will deal
with the pursuers.</font>

101
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. I'll protect them well.</font>

102
00:05:19,670 --> 00:05:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna.</font>

103
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinoshin, keep your mouth shut.
What's your mission?</font>

104
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it not to protect me?</font>

105
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things will be settled if Kikusuke
defeats those guys.</font>

106
00:05:32,970 --> 00:05:34,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then shall we get going, too?</font>

107
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Brother Choji.</font>

108
00:05:37,850 --> 00:05:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! Leave it to me!</font>

109
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji.</font>

110
00:05:42,110 --> 00:05:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go on ahead.</font>

111
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

112
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going back to check things out
at the place where the traps are.</font>

113
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you do that, you may encounter
the pursuers along the way...</font>

114
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's fine.</font>

115
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doing something like waiting
to be attacked isn't my style!</font>

116
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

117
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

118
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I meant...</font>

119
00:06:04,210 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point to our strategy</font>

120
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I have to protect five people
by myself.</font>

121
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, there's no point.</font>

122
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:17,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We came down that path,</font>

123
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so the trap should be
up ahead somewhere.</font>

124
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll take a shortcut!</font>

125
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this? What happened?</font>

126
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it so wet?</font>

127
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are these wounds?!</font>

128
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's...!</font>

129
00:07:12,530 --> 00:07:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you serious?</font>

130
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is something wrong, Brother Choji?</font>

131
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, nothing.</font>

132
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

133
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:23,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel it.</font>

134
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I can sense this much bloodlust.</font>

135
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's close now.</font>

136
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:32,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rain?</font>

137
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:37,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the worst. Rain wipes out
all presence of the enemy.</font>

138
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This rain is weird.</font>

139
00:07:51,110 --> 00:07:52,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gather around, everyone!</font>

140
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay close to me.</font>

141
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

142
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:08,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

143
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that now?!</font>

144
00:08:12,470 --> 00:08:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone! Get under the cart!</font>

145
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:16,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're already under here!</font>

146
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're quick!</font>

147
00:08:18,970 --> 00:08:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

148
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

149
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get down!</font>

150
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

151
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Could you say so
at the start</font>

152
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you're going to
use paper bombs?</font>

153
00:08:52,590 --> 00:08:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. It seems they're gone.</font>

154
00:08:55,890 --> 00:08:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did they disappear?</font>

155
00:08:58,350 --> 00:09:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it obvious?</font>

156
00:09:00,850 --> 00:09:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have no business with a shop
that doesn't have the thing they want.</font>

157
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:05,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thing they want?</font>

158
00:09:05,690 --> 00:09:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

159
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:09,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If a shop's sold out
of the item you want,</font>

160
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'd go to another shop, right?</font>

161
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that the thing that he wants
is in the other group?</font>

162
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that mean?!</font>

163
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's in danger!</font>

164
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, leave your stuff here
and take only what you need!</font>

165
00:09:27,210 --> 00:09:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata is?!</font>

166
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, we'll put up our tents here
for today and rest.</font>

167
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dangerous to move in the dark.</font>

168
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

169
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We finally caught up.</font>

170
00:10:04,250 --> 00:10:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Choji. What is it?</font>

171
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"What is it," nothing.
The situation has changed.</font>

172
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems someone among
these people</font>

173
00:10:14,590 --> 00:10:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is hiding something important.</font>

174
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something important?</font>

175
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It should probably have something
to do with us being chased.</font>

176
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:29,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But who is hiding what?</font>

177
00:10:29,810 --> 00:10:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's most likely you guys,
Shun and Yurinoshin.</font>

178
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:37,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be silly!
What are you saying we're hiding?</font>

179
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't play innocent!</font>

180
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikusuke has been killed
by someone!</font>

181
00:10:43,330 --> 00:10:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

182
00:10:44,490 --> 00:10:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikusuke was?!</font>

183
00:10:47,370 --> 00:10:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't play innocent!</font>

184
00:10:49,370 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikusuke has been killed
by someone!</font>

185
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

186
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikusuke was?!</font>

187
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should he have to
suit up like a Shinobi,</font>

188
00:10:58,590 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">fight those guys and then get killed?!</font>

189
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not necessary to tell you guys.</font>

190
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if that's why we're being chased...</font>

191
00:11:07,930 --> 00:11:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It means you guys are putting
everyone in danger.</font>

192
00:11:11,730 --> 00:11:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't tell us honestly,</font>

193
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we won't be able to protect
even what we can protect.</font>

194
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou...</font>

195
00:11:21,450 --> 00:11:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou?</font>

196
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean Kikusuke?</font>

197
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... And my name isn't Yurinoshin.
It's Yurinojou.</font>

198
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Yurinojou!</font>

199
00:11:35,130 --> 00:11:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person here is Lady Haruna,</font>

200
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the only daughter of the feudal lord
of the Land of Greens.</font>

201
00:11:41,130 --> 00:11:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess?!</font>

202
00:11:43,050 --> 00:11:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess Haruna of the Land of Greens.
You've grown up so much...</font>

203
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess...?</font>

204
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were a woman?!</font>

205
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:56,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna,
it is as these people say.</font>

206
00:11:57,360 --> 00:12:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must not put everyone in danger
by hiding the truth any further.</font>

207
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why is someone like a princess
mingling among merchants?</font>

208
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was information of
a coup d'etat in the Land of Greens.</font>

209
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A coup d'etat?</font>

210
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Greens was a small,
but calm and peaceful land.</font>

211
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:22,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, it was by no means
a prosperous land.</font>

212
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before we realized it,</font>

213
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">more than half of the public officials
had been bought off.</font>

214
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in the world would do that...?</font>

215
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ringleaders are three brothers
called the Janin,</font>

216
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">evil ninja who came from
across the sea.</font>

217
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:37,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Janin?</font>

218
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. They're guys who use
a particular type of ninjutsu</font>

219
00:12:40,690 --> 00:12:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and are called as such
because of their frightfulness.</font>

220
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:49,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've taken many lives
and think nothing of it</font>

221
00:12:49,370 --> 00:12:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if it's for their own gains.</font>

222
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They treat people like worms...</font>

223
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:58,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why the Land of Greens?</font>

224
00:12:59,420 --> 00:13:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why.</font>

225
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But his lordship had Lady Haruna
hide amongst a group of merchants</font>

226
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and got her out of the land.</font>

227
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:12,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou and I were left
with the protection of the princess,</font>

228
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we were insecure with
just the two of us.</font>

229
00:13:14,770 --> 00:13:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So then we hurriedly commissioned
the Hidden Leaf</font>

230
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">under the pretext of protection
from bandits.</font>

231
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you tell us
something that important?</font>

232
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way I could have.
My escape is top secret.</font>

233
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, what would happen
if I were to have told you?</font>

234
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The end result would've been
you guys running away in confusion.</font>

235
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way would I do something
like run away.</font>

236
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou might not have
had to die if</font>

237
00:13:38,330 --> 00:13:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we had understood the situation
from the start.</font>

238
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder.</font>

239
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of you guys might've ended up
like Kikunojou.</font>

240
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're actually fine.</font>

241
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to think you'd go so far as to involve
the old lady and the children.</font>

242
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be!</font>

243
00:13:56,890 --> 00:13:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were you intending to use
the old lady and the kids as decoys</font>

244
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and escape just yourself?!</font>

245
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. What of it?</font>

246
00:14:04,570 --> 00:14:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji! Hinata!</font>

247
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me,
I'm really ticked off right now!</font>

248
00:14:12,870 --> 00:14:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what of it?!</font>

249
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something should happen
in the land,</font>

250
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would become
the only blood relative</font>

251
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the feudal lord of
the Land of Greens.</font>

252
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can just survive,
things could be restored someday,</font>

253
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if the Land of Greens
were to be destroyed.</font>

254
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:32,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?! Just what is it
you think of people's lives?!</font>

255
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive her.</font>

256
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou.</font>

257
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it not your mission to protect me?</font>

258
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still talking about such things...?</font>

259
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait, Naruto!</font>

260
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna, that's true for me.</font>

261
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, these people are different.</font>

262
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission they undertook
was to protect merchants.</font>

263
00:15:08,170 --> 00:15:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was not to protect us.</font>

264
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, what we heard about</font>

265
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:17,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was a D-rank mission to protect
all of the merchants.</font>

266
00:15:18,230 --> 00:15:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protecting a prominent figure of
a land is an A-rank mission.</font>

267
00:15:23,730 --> 00:15:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rank differs by far too much.</font>

268
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you guys saying
you're going to forsake me?</font>

269
00:15:29,450 --> 00:15:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you saying until just now</font>

270
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you didn't trust people like us?</font>

271
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll protect you with my life,
Lady Haruna...</font>

272
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:39,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, Yurinojou!
Kikunojou was your senior disciple.</font>

273
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you alone
could defeat an opponent</font>

274
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whom he couldn't defeat!</font>

275
00:15:44,500 --> 00:15:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will just be our destiny
when that happens, Lady Haruna.</font>

276
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch, Brother Choji.</font>

277
00:16:05,190 --> 00:16:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Awesome, awesome.</font>

278
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry about earlier.</font>

279
00:16:10,650 --> 00:16:12,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It happened so suddenly,
I couldn't stop.</font>

280
00:16:14,410 --> 00:16:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be concerned about me.</font>

281
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, please forgive Lady Haruna.</font>

282
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Greens is a small land.</font>

283
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the sake of the land's survival,</font>

284
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:28,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna was kept under
the custody of another land,</font>

285
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a hostage all by herself
since she was little.</font>

286
00:16:31,970 --> 00:16:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hostage?</font>

287
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It frequently happens in
a small land in a war-torn world.</font>

288
00:16:39,010 --> 00:16:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Lady Haruna returned
from the other land,</font>

289
00:16:42,430 --> 00:16:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she had completely lost her feelings
of trust towards people.</font>

290
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna is also
a victim of a turbulent world.</font>

291
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a village</font>

292
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about one league down
the mountain from here.</font>

293
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being,</font>

294
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll leave the old woman
and the others there.</font>

295
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful now.</font>

296
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys, too!</font>

297
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bye!</font>

298
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you separating them from us?</font>

299
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:13,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They still have value for
my personal use.</font>

300
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still going on about that?</font>

301
00:17:15,630 --> 00:17:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They went so far as to discard
their merchandise for your sake.</font>

302
00:17:20,390 --> 00:17:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we should also leave this place.</font>

303
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must not.</font>

304
00:17:24,770 --> 00:17:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go into hiding,</font>

305
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a possibility of
that group being attacked again.</font>

306
00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:34,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly. This time,
it's our turn to be the decoy</font>

307
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to protect them.</font>

308
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do as you like!</font>

309
00:17:53,130 --> 00:17:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, I'll take care of things here.
Please rest a while.</font>

310
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, do that.</font>

311
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:02,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, if you insist.</font>

312
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:18,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah. Here.
Kikunojou was holding this.</font>

313
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Naruto.</font>

314
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou was a master
of the Flower Ninjutsu</font>

315
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">passed down in the Land of Greens.</font>

316
00:18:30,290 --> 00:18:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We learned together
when we were little</font>

317
00:18:32,630 --> 00:18:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I couldn't beat him even once...</font>

318
00:18:36,090 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I have forever lost
the chance to beat him.</font>

319
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... You still have a chance.</font>

320
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

321
00:18:45,470 --> 00:18:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you beat the guy
who defeated Kikunojou,</font>

322
00:18:48,350 --> 00:18:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will have beaten Kikunojou!</font>

323
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... You're exactly right...!</font>

324
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

325
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Other than the fact that
the enemy uses water,</font>

326
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we have absolutely no idea
what they'll come at us with.</font>

327
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:02,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

328
00:19:04,450 --> 00:19:07,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Flower Ninja Art:!
Flying Flowers: Falling Foliage.</font>

329
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

330
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He changed the trajectory in mid-air?!</font>

331
00:19:27,970 --> 00:19:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

332
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally got you!</font>

333
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:34,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha.</font>

334
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:37,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd
make me look like a fool.</font>

335
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:40,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you finally show yourself.</font>

336
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:43,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will avenge Kikunojou!</font>

337
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try it if you can.</font>

338
00:19:53,500 --> 00:19:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

339
00:20:04,090 --> 00:20:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad. You're one person short.</font>

340
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've set a share for one more.</font>

341
00:20:12,690 --> 00:20:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that.</font>

